{"id":"430928","name":"菌菇乌鸡汤","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/430928/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干猴头茹","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白灵菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"乌鸡块","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姬松茸","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡汤","amount":"1碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干野生猴头菇1个。","img":"images/430928/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猴头菇、姬松茸用淘米水浸泡2小时后洗净。","img":"images/430928/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"乌鸡切成块并焯水待用。","img":"images/430928/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡汤1碗。","img":"images/430928/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将猴头菇半个撕成块状、白灵茹洗净。","img":"images/430928/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"姜切成末。","img":"images/430928/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中加适量水，1碗鸡汤、乌鸡块、姬松茸入锅烧开。","img":"images/430928/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入猴头菇、加适量料酒继续煮制。","img":"images/430928/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入白灵菇、加入盐调味煮一会。","img":"images/430928/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐调味，出锅前再撒葱未。","img":"images/430928/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"菌菇乌鸡汤营养丰富、味道鲜美、宜冬季进补。","img":"images/430928/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}